  <History Date="16-01-21" Author="Sebastian Beutel" Comment="Created - DMX protocol v0.4" Version="1" />
  <History Date="03-03-21" Author="Sebastian Beutel" Comment="Tested with real fixture. Dimmer set to full in Power On as this is required for the layers to output something." Version="4" />
  <History Date="16-03-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Minor changes to control and function names.  Changed 16bit controls to start at 1 to achieve recommended default values.  Added palettes (note charts show dimmer on offset 33.  Assume this is an error)" Version="6" />
